@startuml C1_VVE_Creation_Logical
title C1 – VVE Creation (Logical Relationships)

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  BorderColor Black
}

rectangle "Logistics Operator" as Operator
rectangle "VesselVisitExecutionComponent" as Ui
rectangle "TodoApi VveController" as Proxy
rectangle "OEM Vve API" as OemApi
rectangle "Vvn Repository" as VvnRepo
rectangle "Vve Repository" as VveRepo
rectangle "IAM" as Iam

Operator --> Ui : Initiate VVE creation
Ui --> Proxy : POST /vvns/{vvnId}/vves
Proxy --> Iam : Validate token
Proxy --> OemApi : Forward request
OemApi --> VvnRepo : Validate VVN status
OemApi --> VveRepo : Persist VVE & status
VveRepo --> OemApi : VVE record
OemApi --> Proxy : VVE response
Proxy --> Ui : JSON DTO
Ui --> Operator : Confirmation & status badge

@enduml
